.5x gate, with interest covered 4.4x."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at -5.0% over 3 years, 2.2% over 5 years and 5.1% over 10 years, so growth is decelerating.","At current returns, reinvesting 42% of profits supports about 3.9% a year of fundamental growth, enough to sustain growth.","Free cash flow has compounded 19.8% a year over five years.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 46%.","Capex runs only 0.8x depreciation (3.6% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 8, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.3%), and institutions hold 95%.","Insider trading is two-way: 1 purchase and 3 sales over the past year, net $814K sold.","It returns 9.0% a year to shareholders (7.8% in buybacks and 1.2% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 4.3% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It has paid a dividend for 40 consecutive years, raising it 2.1% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 16,000 employees, each generates about $823K of revenue, 2.2x the Consumer Cyclical median, and revenue has grown 3.7% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $49K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.5M (3x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $2K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INVEST","conv":64,"head":"Invest: trades 16% below fair value of $77.78; 12-1 month momentum +26%.","pros":["Composite 46, above the 39 line (gates 12/26)","Trades 16% below fair value of $77.78","12-1 month momentum +26%","Returns 9.0% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["P/E 32.9x vs sector 18.8x","P/FCF 21.6x vs sector 16.7x"],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":66.11,"vc":{"base":77.78,"base_src":"dcf","bear":55.41,"bull":109.81,"alt_median":26.13,"n_alt":3,"gap":2.4626,"dispersion":0.3286,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (33% dispersion)","DCF is 246% above the other models' median ($26.13)"]},"med":{"pe":18.8184,"ev_eb